ese are words you use when ordering food at a restaurant.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sweet potato fry", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a long thin piece of sweet potato that is cooked in oil ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I get an order of sweet potato fries please?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dipping sauce", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a mixture that you can dip food into before you eat it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Which dipping sauce would you like with your fries? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ketchup", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thick cold red sauce made from tomatoes\t ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love to dip my fries in ketchup.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "chipotle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a flavor that comes from a hot chili pepper  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We have a chipotle flavored sauce.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mayo", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short for mayonnaise; a white sauce, made of egg yolks and oil  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I get some extra mayo?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "aioli", "type": "name"}, {"content": " mayonnaise seasoned with garlic and other